  "scenes": [
    {
      "narration": "In a green meadow at the edge of the woods, there lived a hare. He was quick, he was clever, and he was very, very proud.",
      "camera": {"zoom": [1.0, 1.05], "center": [[960, 540], [900, 560]]},
      "items": [
        {"actor": "sun", "at": [1640, 210], "scale": 0.85, "rig": "glow"},
        {"actor": "cloud", "at": [520, 200], "anims": [{"type": "drift", "amp": 40, "period": 9}]},
        {"actor": "cloud_long", "at": [1120, 120], "scale": 0.7, "anims": [{"type": "drift", "amp": 30, "period": 11, "phase": 0.4}]},
        {"actor": "tree_dark", "at": [140, 790], "scale": 1.3, "rig": "sway"},
        {"actor": "tree", "at": [1790, 800], "scale": 1.1, "rig": "sway"},
        {"actor": "ground", "at": [0, 790]},
        {"actor": "grass_tuft", "rig": "sway", "scatter": {"n": 9, "area": [80, 830, 1840, 900], "scale": [0.7, 1.1], "seed": 2}},
        {"actor": "flower_red", "at": [430, 880], "rig": "sway"},
        {"actor": "flower_purple", "at": [1450, 885], "scale": 0.9, "rig": "sway"},
        {"actor": "hare", "at": [560, 830], "scale": 0.95, "rig": "run",
         "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [1180, 830], "t": [0.0, 0.55], "ease": "inout"}, {"type": "hop", "height": 55, "period": 0.34, "t": [0.0, 0.55]}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Every morning he raced the wind across the grass. \"Nobody in the whole wide world,\" he boasted, \"is as fast as me!\"",
      "camera": {"zoom": [1.04, 1.0]},
      "items": [
        {"actor": "cloud", "at": [1500, 180], "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [300, 180], "t": [0, 1], "ease": "linear"}]},
        {"actor": "cloud", "at": [2100, 300], "scale": 0.7, "seed": 3, "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [900, 300], "t": [0, 1], "ease": "linear"}]},
        {"actor": "bird_small", "at": [700, 260], "rig": "flap", "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [1300, 220], "t": [0, 1], "ease": "linear"}]},
        {"actor": "bird_small", "at": [620, 320], "scale": 0.8, "rig": "flap", "seed": 2, "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [1220, 290], "t": [0, 1], "ease": "linear"}]},
        {"actor": "hill", "at": [1350, 860], "scale": [1.2, 0.9], "z": -2},
        {"actor": "ground", "at": [0, 820]},
        {"actor": "grass_tuft", "rig": "sway", "scatter": {"n": 10, "area": [60, 860, 1860, 905], "scale": [0.7, 1.0], "seed": 5}},
        {"actor": "hare", "at": [-300, 840], "rig": "run",
         "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [2300, 840], "t": [0.02, 0.45], "ease": "linear"}, {"type": "hop", "height": 70, "period": 0.34}]},
        {"actor": "hare", "at": [-300, 840], "rig": ["run"],
         "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [900, 840], "t": [0.5, 0.75], "ease": "out"}, {"type": "hop", "height": 60, "period": 0.34, "t": [0.5, 0.75]}],
         "part_anims": [{"part": "mouth", "type": "pulse", "amp": 0.3, "period": 0.3, "t": [0.75, 1.0]}], "reveal": ["mouth"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "One day, the hare met a tortoise plodding slowly along the path. \"Ha!\" he laughed. \"You are so slow, you will never get anywhere at all!\"",
      "items": [
        {"actor": "sun", "at": [1700, 170], "scale": 0.7, "rig": "glow"},
        {"actor": "pine", "at": [1500, 760], "scale": 1.0, "rig": "sway"},
        {"actor": "tree", "at": [250, 770], "scale": 1.15, "rig": "sway"},
        {"actor": "ground", "at": [0, 760]},
        {"part": {"shape": "stroke", "points": [[-200, 900], [500, 860], [1100, 890], [2200, 850]], "width": 90, "paint": "path", "cap": "flat"}, "detail": 0.9},
        {"actor": "flower_yellow", "at": [180, 905], "rig": "sway"},
        {"actor": "tortoise", "at": [560, 880], "scale": 0.95, "rig": "walk",
         "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [760, 880], "t": [0, 1], "ease": "linear"}]},
        {"actor": "hare", "at": [1350, 875], "flip": true, "scale": 0.95, "rig": "laugh", "reveal": ["mouth"],
         "anims": [{"type": "hop", "height": 25, "period": 0.45, "t": [0.45, 1.0]}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "The tortoise blinked her old, wise eyes. \"Slow I may be,\" she said, \"but I will race you, if you like.\"",
      "camera": {"zoom": [1.32, 1.42], "center": [[960, 640], [980, 650]]},
      "items": [
        {"actor": "tree", "at": [180, 780], "scale": 1.15},
        {"actor": "ground", "at": [0, 760]},
        {"part": {"shape": "stroke", "points": [[-200, 900], [500, 860], [1100, 890], [2200, 850]], "width": 90, "paint": "path", "cap": "flat"}, "detail": 0.9},
        {"actor": "tortoise", "at": [770, 880], "scale": 0.95, "rig": "proud"},
        {"actor": "hare", "at": [1240, 875], "flip": true, "scale": 0.95, "rig": "idle",
         "anims": [{"type": "rotate", "to": -6, "t": [0.55, 0.75]}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "News of the race spread through the woods. All the animals came to watch, and the fox waved the flag: ready, steady, go!",
      "camera": {"zoom": [1.0, 1.06], "center": [[960, 540], [960, 580]]},
      "items": [
        {"actor": "tree_dark", "at": [1720, 780], "scale": 1.3, "rig": "sway"},
        {"actor": "bird_small", "at": [1640, 420], "rig": "flap", "anims": [{"type": "bob", "amp": 10, "period": 1.3}]},
        {"actor": "bird_small", "at": [1790, 380], "rig": "flap", "seed": 4, "anims": [{"type": "bob", "amp": 12, "period": 1.1}]},
        {"actor": "ground", "at": [0, 760]},
        {"actor": "fox", "at": [300, 860], "scale": 1.0, "rig": "wave", "anims": [{"type": "hop", "height": 18, "period": 0.6, "t": [0.75, 1.0]}]},
        {"actor": "tortoise", "at": [770, 900], "scale": 0.85, "rig": "idle"},
        {"actor": "hare", "at": [1100, 880], "scale": 0.85, "rig": "idle", "anims": [{"type": "squash", "amp": 0.05, "period": 0.5}]},
        {"actor": "grass_tuft", "rig": "sway", "scatter": {"n": 6, "area": [900, 860, 1600, 900], "scale": [0.7, 0.9], "seed": 9}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Whoosh! Off shot the hare, so fast that the flowers bent over in the wind. And off went the tortoise too: step, step, step.",
      "items": [
        {"actor": "cloud", "at": [700, 210], "anims": [{"type": "drift", "amp": 30, "period": 8}]},
        {"actor": "ground", "at": [0, 780]},
        {"actor": "flower_yellow", "at": [960, 880], "rig": "sway", "part_anims": [{"part": "stem", "type": "swing", "deg": 28, "period": 0.5, "t": [0.08, 0.34]}]},
        {"actor": "flower_red", "at": [1260, 870], "rig": "sway", "part_anims": [{"part": "stem", "type": "swing", "deg": 24, "period": 0.45, "t": [0.12, 0.38]}]},
        {"actor": "grass_tuft", "rig": "sway", "scatter": {"n": 8, "area": [100, 840, 1800, 900], "scale": [0.7, 1.0], "seed": 12}},
        {"actor": "hare", "at": [500, 860], "rig": "run",
         "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [2400, 820], "t": [0.05, 0.3], "ease": "in"}, {"type": "hop", "height": 60, "period": 0.3}]},
        {"actor": "tortoise", "at": [200, 880], "rig": "walk",
         "anims": [{"type": "move", "to": [560, 880], "t": [0.4, 1.0], "ease": "linear"}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Soon the hare was far, far ahead. He looked back, and he could not even see the tortoise. \"I have plenty of time,\" he yawned. \"I think I'll take a little nap.\"",
